  "scope": "Two disposable single-member etcd v3.6.8 processes, each in Docker network mode none. The manual case uses three public synthetic marker keys and one bounded deleted padding key, observes an old exact-key read before compaction, compacts the current revision, verifies that only the old read is rejected, and measures reclaimed database bytes after one online defrag. A second process checks periodic auto-compaction with a real 8-second retention window. A separate three-member etcd fixture uses a real UTC CronJob, verifies member health before and after each sequential action, and withholds all maintenance when a health check fails. Provider guarantees, production workload availability and real retention configuration stay open.",
